  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2802,
      "text": "Indeed, those who came up with the slander[7] are a group among you. Do not think that it is bad for you, rather it is good for you[8]. Each one of them is responsible for what he earned of the sin, and the one who played the major role[9], for him there will be a grave punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2803,
      "text": "If only the believing men and women had thought well of themselves, and said, “This is a clear slander!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2804,
      "text": "Why did they not produce four witnesses to prove it? Now, since they failed to produce witnesses, they are the liars before Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2805,
      "text": "Were it not for Allah’s grace and mercy upon you in this world and in the Hereafter, you would have been afflicted with a great punishment for that [lie] in which you were involved,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2806,
      "text": "when you were passing it from one tongue[10] to the other, and saying with your mouths what you had no knowledge of, and were taking it lightly, whereas with Allah it was a grave offense.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2807,
      "text": "If only you had said when you heard it, “How can we speak about such a thing! Glory be to You [O Allah]! This is a monstrous slander!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2808,
      "text": "Allah admonishes you not to repeat such a thing ever, if you are [truly] believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2809,
      "text": "Allah makes the revelations clear to you, for Allah is All-Knowing, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 351,
      "ruku": 302,
      "hizbQuarter": 140,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2810,
      "text": "Indeed, those who like to see indecency[11] spread among the believers will have a painful punishment in this world and the Hereafter; Allah knows and you do not know[12].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 24,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النُّورِ",
        "englishName": "An-Noor",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Light",
        "numberOfAyahs": 64,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
